      "content": "but isn't that just a way of redefining quality to make up for the lack of technique? when you say it's about the \"force of the idea,\" it sounds like we're just accepting mediocre craftsmanship as long as the politics are \"right.\" doesn't that inherently devalue the historical standards of art?",
